CODEGEN.md §2.8, DECISIONS 229: a copy of a uses b's copy under its own owning root, or b's only copy; b has several go copies and none under services, so a's copy under services has none to use (E8004 noCopy). Its copy under features uses b's.
-- b/b.canon --
package b

/// A colour.
enum Tone { red, blue }

emit go { out: ["@features/b/", "@sovcommon/b/"] }
-- a/a.canon --
package a

import b { Tone }

/// A badge.
record Badge {
  /// Its colour.
  tone: Tone
}

emit go { out: ["@features/a/", "@services/a/"] }
